  3.978428276117884*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"844cb0f9-687e-4bd0-bdb2-\
6f5b458368d5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We know that  ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["z", 
    RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "adf632bc-1efb-403d-8300-4a4a778ac834"],
 " has two values.  Everybody decided (including computer programs) to chose \
the same principle branch!  Can we somehow plot more than one bit of the \
function. Can we pllot"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978427799923956*^9, 3.978427825588434*^9}, {
  3.9784282839725103`*^9, 3.9784283296671734`*^9}, {3.9784287300045366`*^9, 
  3.978428750854354*^9}, {3.978428966319422*^9, 3.9784289718595824`*^9}, {
  3.9784290059316335`*^9, 
  3.978429011187806*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ac0c4e89-e768-41fb-9d04-\
ddf7346a00ba"],

